C       NREGN     3       (pathname[(3*NREGN)  ])   => Sub-region NREGN; crop 3; seasonal crop efficiency
C
C   IR    ;  Sub-region number
C   CRTYPE;  Crop type number
C   PATH  ;  Pathname for the time series record
C
